The rest of the paper is organized as follows. In Section~\ref{comparison}, we prove a weak comparison principle. Based on this, we construct subsolutions, which have the same form as those in \cite{2025-JDE-TaoWinkler}, to detect finite-time blow-up in Section~\ref{subsolution}. Finally, we prove the global boundedness in Section~\ref{global boundedness}.

